  "reason": "Existing evidence shows RNA-only multiprofile setups with scvi_n200 encoder and transformer aggregation achieve high accuracy (0.653). This experiment tests adding image data (ViT-L) to this strong baseline, isolating the effect of multimodal fusion. It directly addresses whether combining RNA and image modalities improves performance, leveraging the best RNA-only configuration while testing the critical design choice of image modality inclusion. This balances exploitation of known RNA-only strengths with exploration of multimodal potential."
}

